Subject: [PATCH 1/3] ADD UI harness coverage for reviewed completion decisions

Exercise the terminal harness state that marks a reviewed patch chat as awaiting the yes/no decision, closes it on an affirmative answer, and reopens it as working when follow-up text is sent. This keeps the DONE, CLOSED, and working row states covered through the same render path used by the terminal UI.
